{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d2_doc0035","statement":"Two datasets were used, collected a year apart, in October 2014 and October 2015.","source_span":"two datasets, collected in October 2014 and October 2015"}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d2_doc0035","statement":"Classification experiments were run on all 217 countries in the datasets, as well as on the top 25 countries by tweet volume.","source_span":"classification experiments on all 217 countries in our datasets, as well as on the top 25 countries"}
{"type":"fact","doc_id":"d2_doc0035","statement":"Choosing an appropriate combination of tweet content and metadata can lead to improvements of between 20% and 50%.","source_span":"substantial improvements of between 20\\% and 50\\%"}
